%% NOTE: api/routers/documents.py OCR get+correct endpoints not confirmed in source — steps 9-14 inferred from plan spec
%% OCR engine: QARI (NAMAA-Space/Qari-OCR-v0.3-VL-2B-Instruct) — Qwen2VL-based VLM, NOT Surya
sequenceDiagram
    participant Judge
    participant FastAPI
    participant MinIO
    participant QARIEngine
    participant Qdrant
    participant MongoDB

    Judge->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/files/upload (PDF or image, case_id)
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: validate MIME type + size (≤20MB API limit)
    FastAPI->>MinIO: store binary file → object_key
    MinIO-->>FastAPI: object_key

    FastAPI->>QARIEngine: run_ocr(file_path) [DocumentProcessor.OCR]
    Note over QARIEngine: ingest: PDF→PIL at 400 DPI or image load
    QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: restore_image — CLAHE contrast on LAB L-channel
    QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: perspective_correct — Canny edge-contour\n+ adaptive-threshold fallback + safety guards
    QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: Qwen2VL inference (8-bit quantized, GPU)\nmax_new_tokens=4000
    QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: normalize_numerals — Arabic-Indic digit conversion
    QARIEngine->>QARIEngine: compute_page_confidence from token softmax probabilities
    QARIEngine-->>FastAPI: OCRDocumentResult (pages: raw_text, normalized_text, confidence, word_confidences)

    Note over FastAPI: confidence tier: high ≥0.85 / medium ≥0.60 / low

    FastAPI->>Qdrant: upsert chunks → case_docs collection (filtered by case_id)
    Qdrant-->>FastAPI: ack
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: store document metadata (doc_type, party, confidence, object_key)
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: document_id
    FastAPI-->>Judge: document_id + OCR preview + confidence tier

    Judge->>FastAPI: GET /api/v1/cases/{case_id}/documents/{doc_id}/ocr
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: fetch document record
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: OCR text + confidence
    FastAPI-->>Judge: OCR text + confidence

    Judge->>FastAPI: PATCH /api/v1/cases/{case_id}/documents/{doc_id}/ocr (corrected_text)
    FastAPI->>Qdrant: delete old chunks for doc_id
    FastAPI->>Qdrant: re-index corrected text chunks
    Qdrant-->>FastAPI: ack
    FastAPI->>MongoDB: update document record (corrected_text, human_reviewed=true)
    MongoDB-->>FastAPI: ack
    FastAPI-->>Judge: confirmation
